[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-stanbic-ibtc-blue-internship-program-2026-apply-now-215":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},215,"stanbic-ibtc-blue-internship-program-2026-apply-now-215","Stanbic Ibtc Blue Internship Program 2026: Apply Now","\u003Cp>The Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program offers hands-on workplace experience and certification, competitive monthly stipend, coaching and guidance from experienced professionals.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Stanbic IBTC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ftrainings\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on workplace experience\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Certification\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Competitive monthly stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coaching\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Mentorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: May 15, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Stanbic IBTC is now accepting applications for the \u003Cstrong>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Programme 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This prestigious internship offers exceptional students the chance to gain hands-on professional experience, mentorship from industry leaders, and exposure to real business operations in a dynamic corporate environment.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Blue Internship Programme is designed for high-potential undergraduates who are ready to build their dream career path.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>It provides a structured platform for young talents to develop practical skills, understand the financial services industry, and demonstrate their capabilities in a professional setting.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Interns at the Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program 2026 will:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Gain valuable \u003Cstrong>real-world work experience\u003C\u002Fstrong> in a leading financial institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Receive \u003Cstrong>mentorship\u003C\u002Fstrong> from experienced professionals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Work on meaningful projects that impact the business\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Build a strong professional network\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Stand out in future job applications with Stanbic IBTC experience on your CV\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Potential pathway to full-time employment for high-performing interns\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have a minimum CGPA of 3.5 or the equivalent of a Second-Class Upper\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have completed at least one semester of undergraduate studies\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must be forward thinking with a creative edge\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Updated CV\u002FResume\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic transcripts or CGPA proof\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Cover letter \u002F Statement of Interest\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Sometimes a recommendation letter\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Stanbic IBTC Blue Internship Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit your application online (usually through the company’s career portal)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fsurvey.stanbicibtc.com\u002Fsurvey\u002FruntimeApp.app?invitationId=0KiS7000003W313&amp;surveyName=blue_internship_application_2026&amp;UUID=b7fa2390-b3c0-46b2-b8a6-016df93ec9db\">https:\u002F\u002Fsurvey.stanbicibtc.com\u002Fsurvey\u002FruntimeApp.app?invitationId=0KiS7000003W313&amp;surveyName=blue_internship_application_2026&amp;UUID=b7fa2390-b3c0-46b2-b8a6-016df93ec9db\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-05 17:19:08",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fstanbic-ibtc-blue-internship-program-2026-apply-now\u002F69fa187c1a